    title: "scala: a type alias (lila type Fu[A] = Future[A]) is never expanded, so 1,016 receivers WI-gokop newly types carry a hint (Fu/Funit) that qualifies to no module and has no element"  # b21b
    status: todo_hard  # b21b
    priority: 3  # b21b
    parent:  # b21b
