  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e (WI-gokop merged as d928c4624a). Fixture: `type Fu[A] = Future[A]`, `type W = FileWriter`; def aliased(): Fu[Int] then b.map(...) emits scala:external:0-0:map with receiver_type_hint=Fu and no dst_ref; def writer(): W then w.write emits scala:external:0-0:write hint=W. Controls with Future[Int] / FileWriter reach scala.concurrent.Future / java.io.FileWriter. No alias handling in scala.py (grep). Premise holds; the branch it cites is now integrated. MECHANISM: scala.py records no type_definition aliases, so a return type or annotation naming an alias is used verbatim as receiver_type_hint and qualifies to no module. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-modib, WI-punat."  # faa0
